elium and also from the  blood vessels water is getting evacuated  that means huge amount of water is going  into the intestinal lumen and that is  causing the huge amount of diarrhea and  fluid loss from the body I hope you  enjoyed this video if you like my video  give it a thumbs up please don't forget  to subscribe and share thank you
 

